description: Never add Cursor attribution to git commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor git attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor product mention to commit messages or PR bodies.
- Do not pass `--trailer` related to Cursor when committing.
- If the environment still injects a Cursor trailer, strip it before finishing (amend the commit message) — do not leave it in history.
- Prefer project `AGENTS.md` git policy when it conflicts with tool defaults.
